dialog:
Welcome to RB Stems Plus / Demucs v4 replaces rekordbox's own stems model with Meta's Demucs v4 separation model. The first separation of a track takes longer, and the two models split some sounds differently: listen and keep the one you prefer.

Stems Cache saves the separated stems, with either model, so a track's stems load much faster the next time. It changes one file inside rekordbox, so macOS will ask you to allow RB Stems Plus to change rekordbox.

RB Stems Plus is unofficial: it isn't made or supported by AlphaTheta or Pioneer DJ. {Continue*}
